		</h2>
		<p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
			{/* PLACEHOLDER body copy */}
			Placeholder: meeting time, location, and a sentence about which majors and
			skill levels are welcome.
		</p>
		<a
			href="#"
			class="mt-10 inline-block rounded-sm bg-accent px-8 py-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-black transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-accent-hover"
